    {
      "tag": "BUTTON",
      "text": "RECORDS → MEMORY / DISK\nOutput & spools\n\nRequired output policy and explicit disk chunk caps. Record order, hashing, spill, cleanup and controlled capacity results remain.\n\n49 callables · inspect →",
      "id": "",
      "href": null,
      "type": null
    },
    {
      "tag": "BUTTON",
      "text": "CLIENT ↔ DAEMON SOCKET\nTransport & codecs\n\nRequired transport/output/delivery values; timeout chosen by purpose; separate counters. Fetch failure settles its completion. Later completion errors can replace the first failure.\n\n16 callables · inspect →",
      "id": "",
      "href": null,
      "type": null
    },
    {
      "tag": "BUTTON",
      "text": "OWNERSHIP → READY → STOPPED\nLifecycle & registry\n\nRequired startup/shutdown policy; counted child retries; no healthy-start deadline. Ownership fences, signal sequence, stale-record cleanup during status and fire-and-forget idle callback stay. Explicit grace override remains.\n\n53 callables · inspect →",
      "id": "",
      "href": null,
      "type": null
    },
    {
      "tag": "BUTTON",
      "text": "RSS → SHED / REPLACE / DRAIN\nResources & workers\n\nExisting policy supplies memory, sampling and replacement values. Parent parses the worker snapshot before spawning. Generation checks and hysteresis stay.\n\n31 callables · inspect →",
      "id": "",
      "href": null,
      "type": null
    },
    {
      "tag": "BUTTON",
      "text": "EVENTS → QUEUE → ROTATED FILES\nDiagnostics\n\nRequired diagnostics slice. Same closed event schema, hashed correlation, best-effort writes and dropping behavior; trace retention also uses policy.\n\n11 callables · inspect →",
      "id": "",
      "href": null,
      "type": null
    },
    {
      "tag": "BUTTON",
      "text": "CONSTRUCT THE CONSUMER GRAPH\nCLI composition\n\nExecutor, commands, dispatcher and WorkspaceDaemon pass slices. Ready memory reports use policy. Mechanisms remain in apps/cli; worker/process entry wiring also changes.\n\n18 callables · inspect →",
      "id": "",
      "href": null,
      "type": null
    },
    {
      "tag": "BUTTON",
      "text": "ADAPTERS OUTSIDE PRODUCTION\nTest & benchmark surface\n\nSeven exported helper adapters translate knobs into validated policy. Spill fixtures change, old recipe tests disappear, boundary string checks expand. Benchmark APIs remain.\n\n35 callables · inspect →",
      "id": "",
      "href": null,
      "type": null
    },
